{"id":"de_ga_t","lemma":"dégât","pos":"noun","rank":2127,"glosses":["damage"],"ipa":"/de.ɡa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5b/Fr-d%C3%A9g%C3%A2t.ogg/Fr-d%C3%A9g%C3%A2t.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dégâts"},"formAudio":{"dégâts":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-d%C3%A9g%C3%A2ts.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ne pouvez-vous pas réparer les dégâts ?","en":"Can't you repair the damage?","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to repair, fix, mend"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"J'ai payé pour les dégâts.","en":"I paid for the damage.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to pay","l":"payer"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"L'incendie a fait beaucoup de dégâts.","en":"The fire caused a lot of damage.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"fire"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Y eut-il beaucoup de dégâts ?","en":"Was there much damage?","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Il n'y eut aucun dégât permanent.","en":"There was no permanent damage.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"none, no-one"},null,{"g":"permanent"}]}]}